 ## Background
-Global conditioning and the mapping network architecture were introduced in "Unconstrained Scene Generation with Locally Conditioned Radiance Fields" (2021) [S1]. The concept of encoding a whole data sample in one latent vector is discussed in "Introduction to Neural Fields" (2026) [S2, unofficial]. The mapping network follows the StyleGAN architecture [S1][S2, unofficial].
+Originated in the context of unconstrained scene generation with locally conditioned radiance fields [S1]. The mapping network concept is based on StyleGAN [S1][S2, unofficial].
 
